{
    "_notes": [
        "Each term is a Python regular expression, matched case-insensitively against the fields below.",
        "A paper matches a category if any of the category's terms appears in any of the fields.",
        "Plain words work as-is ('robot' also matches 'robots' and 'robotic'). Use [\\s-] to allow a space or hyphen, \\b for a word boundary.",
        "Category names must match the taxonomy exactly (2-model-comparison/task_taxonomy.json)."
    ],
